Sval: remove Firefox's site data list

Settings › Sites lists every site storing data, with its size and Clear
everywhere (Storing data), so Firefox's Manage data… dialog and the
setting that opens it are gone. The confirm Firefox's site data manager
asks before a removal (siteDataRemoveSelected.xhtml) stays, since
SiteDataManager still opens it.

